OL,3,GNEWSABreak-ins becoming 'commonplace',
OL,4,Asay pub staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreak-ins and antisocial behaviour are
OL,7,Fbecoming commonplace in an area of
OL,8,FHull, business owners and staff say.
OL,10,FIt comes after three pubs were targeted
OL,11,Fover the bank holiday weekend, with
OL,12,Fincidents at Queens Hotel and St Johns
OL,13,FHotel, on Queens Road, and Newland Tap,
OL,14,Fon Newland Avenue.
OL,16,FJack Stone, who works at Queens Hotel,
OL,17,Fsaid: "It seems to be almost a weekly
OL,18,Foccurrence that people are just coming
OL,19,Fin, breaking doors down, [breaking]
OL,20,Fwindows, stealing a whole bunch of
OL,21,Fstuff."
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
