OL,3,GNEWSABreak-ins becoming 'commonplace',
OL,4,Asay pub staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Humberside Police spokesperson said
OL,7,Fofficers were working closely with the
OL,8,Flocal authority and partner
OL,9,Forganisations to "tackle criminality on
OL,10,Fthe Avenues in Hull".
